From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: neonjava <neonjavadev@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 16:44:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Sync player inventories between servers

Port Patch 24 to 1.21.1: forward container/item interaction events for external owners, add inventory sync packet handlers, and add dirty-tracked inventory/list wrappers for cross-server state updates.

